/473393325_632248002870730_3006640312548239801_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3KsrbYFOX0AQ7kNvwFr3skC&_nc_oc=AdpTUPWEhqaICGTDW0rX8Qmr4Qi176SavsCnTo1hS8whImPON_zz25mqpawHo-76WnM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afz5I6faCmH-mSDcf5xZjKqbN4KXytsyV0jygLH4NKobzw&oe=69CFB886"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_image.png", "id": "622232867635132", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_622232870968465_3205372193996420289_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DquqXtjsqA4Q7kNvwHlXyd5&_nc_oc=AdoMPNUbzuwnL9T_yR_E_idlD54l2i-osmzOfxK879_UqWxs8KV7fb6FaXxnvabn7nE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxpTQqT2LjjwgCXxCKZrdCME4vnsTy2fFHpOEawKJXbpQ&oe=69CFC195"}, "display_name": "SECRET TAG V2", "keywords": ["parkour", "hard", "team", "fun", "brain"], "long_description": "SECRET TAG V2 is an action-packed movement game that takes speed and agility to the next level! With fluid parkour mechanics, wall-running, sliding, and precise air control, players can navigate dynamic environments with style. The game features a thrilling tag-based gameplay where quick reflexes and strategic movement are the keys to victory.\n\nHone your skills in a specially designed practice area, filled with obstacles, ramps, and interactive elements that let you perfect every trick and technique. Whether you're chasing down opponents or making a daring escape, every match is a test of speed, skill, and creativity. Are you fast enough to stay ahead?", "short_description": "SECRET TAG V2 is an adrenaline-packed movement-based game where speed and skill are everything! Master advanced parkour mechanics, smooth slides, and high-speed dashes as you compete in intense tag matches. Train in a dynamic practice area designed to sharpen your reflexes and perfect your movement. Whether you're chasing or escaping, every second counts in this fast-paced experience!"}]